{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach it. If close, take it, inspect properties, do task. Else, search. list of available nodes: <SubTree ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = InspectObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    />\"",
